Package: scDEcrypter
Title: Viral Infection Analysis with Partially Labeled Single-Cell RNA Sequencing Data
Version: 0.8.7
Authors@R: c(
    person(given="Rhonda", family="Bacher", email="rbacher@ufl.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(given="Aaron", family="Molstad", role = "aut"),
    person(given="Luer", family="Zhong", email="luerzhong@ufl.edu", role = "aut")
    )
Author: Rhonda Bacher [aut, cre], Aaron Molstad [aut], Luer Zhong [aut]
Maintainer: Rhonda Bacher <rbacher@ufl.edu>
Description: Fits a penalized Gaussian multiway mixture model to transformed
    single-cell RNA sequencing data with partially observed infection labels.
    Estimates infection-state probabilities and performs permutation-based
    differential expression tests on held-out cells.
